{"games":[{"id":5987922834,"name":"[actual 4x] rage at furry game simulator","desc":"You have been locked inside a facility by the Black Iron Corporation. Your objective is to fight against infecteds of many types (and colours?) or you can join them and fight against the ones who betrayed you.\nJust do what comes natural.\n\n⭐ 2x XP & Blood every weekend!\n✨ Join the group for an exclusive chat tag and 10% extra blood & XP income!","path":"/game/5987922834-actual-4x-rage-at-furry-game-simulator","slug":"5987922834-actual-4x-rage-at-furry-game-simulator","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/cb375fec777dab313294ac822f6193adea56cee638287c3f5907ea2513a12df8.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3b53d9adfe41224b2841ddbeecb6c688/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":2,"visitor":31174008,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-04-04T12:22:18.213Z","creator":{"name":"super secret bunny cult","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":7424863999,"name":"🎤Super Hero VS God Tycoon","desc":"🎤Spatial voice🎤\r\nYou can chat with each other via this way，Welcome to have a try~\r\n\r\nWelcome to the Super Hero VS God Tycoon! Where you can become one of the 16 superheroes and Gods, build up your Tycoon base to unspeakable size! Unlock special powers and items, battle other players, be the mightiest Tycoon!\r\n\r\n6000Likes SP Weapon Released!\r\nNext SP Weapon needs: 15k Likes\r\n\r\nLeave a Like and Favorite for more updates!","path":"/game/7424863999-super-hero-vs-god-tycoon","slug":"7424863999-super-hero-vs-god-tycoon","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/1f0cf2532f7c3d0f67b20858c2a2e6f209c2ef88c1506e610d00d12279f67ae3.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-312450dc6edb928dd8d19fdfc18a89a0/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":2,"visitor":23402605,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-02-21T05:34:53.737Z","creator":{"name":"White Dragon Studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":712717349,"name":"[EASTER🐰] Obby King Remastered","desc":"Obby King is a fast-paced obstacle course game built for players who enjoy competitive challenges and exciting gameplay. Race through 100+ unique obbies, beat the clock, and compete against other players in a single continuous tournament experience.\n\nThere are rounds. Whether you’re new to Obby King or an experienced obby player, the game is easy to pick up and challenging to master.\n\nStay focused. Move fast. Claim the crown.\n\nFeatures\n- Round-style gameplay - compete from start to finish\n- Time-based challenges - speed and accuracy matter\n- Progress-based competition - keep up to stay in the action\n- 100+ obby maps with increasing difficulty\n- Earn coins and customise your character\n- Leaderboards - track progress and show your skills\n\nInvite your friends, enter the tournament, and see who rises to the top.","path":"/game/712717349-easter-obby-king-remastered","slug":"712717349-easter-obby-king-remastered","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/aca450f9cedff43fd4ace77723f3316b286655c35e7b85893a5c2f92a5dcec62.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-0144636a68ff59332c41d79b135bc635/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":2,"visitor":59756209,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-04-30T19:48:28.849Z","creator":{"name":"Obby King Community","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":7200003285,"name":"Super Skyward Towers","desc":"🏆 Use DOUBLE JUMPS, WALL JUMPS, and other parkour abilities to avoid obstacles and climb towers! \n🐶 Earn pets that give ABILITIES!\n👑 Fight for the CROWN to unlock harder towers!\n\n✉️ Bug reports and feedback may be submitted using the social links below! \n","path":"/game/7200003285-super-skyward-towers","slug":"7200003285-super-skyward-towers","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/c9975f35ebf96e5bc09d1e6da4300198cbc98a7253154cb0bc1a36f008cc0d28.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d63faf9832227f13cd4efdce48477b8d/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":2,"visitor":137966381,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-06-27T22:40:33.664Z","creator":{"name":"Phoenix Entertainment","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":583507031,"name":"PAPERS, PLEASE! [❗UPDATE]","desc":"🌿💼 𝐖𝐄𝐋𝐂𝐎𝐌𝐄 𝐓𝐎 𝐓𝐇𝐄 𝐆𝐑𝐄𝐒𝐓𝐈𝐍 𝐅𝐄𝐃𝐄𝐑𝐀𝐋 𝐁𝐎𝐑𝐃𝐄𝐑!\nYour objective is to cross the heavily guarded border checkpoint - alive. Immigrate using your personal documents or attempt to sneak past the Border Guards. Or, rebel against the regime and fight back with EZIC to reclaim territory.\nReady to cross the line? Play now & shape your life.\n\nPapers, Please is a roleplay game where players attempt to immigrate into the fictional city of Grestin. Cross the imperialist fortress and work a job to get paid, or live a life of crime - sneak past border guards & steal from stores to make a living; it's up to you. Inspired by Lucas Pope's \"Papers Please\".\n\n💣 Purchase bundles and save on weapons and tools in-game: https://www.roblox.com/games/12349604659\n⚔️ Join the Military and begin your career in the Federation: https://www.roblox.com/groups/3029096\n📜 Stay up to date with game rules and guidelines: https://devforum.roblox.com/t/-/4174028","path":"/game/583507031-papers-please-update","slug":"583507031-papers-please-update","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/7b3c81bfaad9e1793bb61b93c285996be3d76ff957253ac4506b4d807f4dcd01.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-539bf4090dff21309a15b96bc79ce64c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":2,"visitor":41301177,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-05-31T21:44:22.661Z","creator":{"name":"Imperialist Robloxian Federation","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":5665787539,"name":"Gods Of Glory","desc":"","path":"/game/5665787539-gods-of-glory","slug":"5665787539-gods-of-glory","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/im